msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Minori「Alrighty, one special Taiga yogurt＿parfait, coming right up!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Muy bien, un parfait de yogur especial＿Taiga, saliendo de inmediato!」"

msgid "Taiga「Thanks, Minorin. You're busy even＿during the holidays, huh?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Gracias, Minorin. Estás ocupada＿hasta en vacaciones, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are there fewer employees here than＿usual?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Hay menos empleados aquí＿que de costumbre?」"

msgid "Minori「You betcha～ The college-age＿part-timers all took time off to go＿home for the holidays.」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ya lo creo～! Los universitarios de＿medio tiempo pidieron días libres para＿volver a casa por las fiestas.」"

msgid "Taiga「So your winter break isn't much of a＿break, is it, Minorin?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Así que tus vacaciones de invierno no＿son de mucho descanso, ¿verdad, Minorin?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hey Taiga, shouldn't we leave after＿you eat that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Oye, Taiga, ¿no deberíamos＿irnos después de que comas eso?」"

msgid "Taiga「Why?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Por qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Why?\"...... Well, it's overcrowded. Look,＿there are people waiting in line to get＿in.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Por qué\"?...... Bueno, está＿llenísimo. Mira, hay gente haciendo＿fila para entrar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I guess that's alright, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, supongo que está bien, entonces.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh...... You want anything?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah...... ¿Quieres algo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Let me see. Perhaps I shall request＿Darjeeling tea with milk.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Déjame ver. Tal vez solicite＿té Darjeeling con leche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's with that pretentious turn of＿phrase?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y esa forma tan pretenciosa de hablar?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh dear, it seems my noble breeding is＿shooing. Ohohoho!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Oh cielos, parece que mi noble＿cuna se reduce. ¡Ohohoho!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't you mean \"showing\"? You're not＿shooing it anywhere.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿No querrás decir \"reluce\"?＿No estás reduciendo nada.」"

msgid "Taiga「You're so nitpicky.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eres tan quisquilloso.」"

msgid "Taiga「You sure know a lot for being a stupid＿COFFEE drinker.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vaya que sabes mucho para ser＿un tonto bebedor de CAFÉ.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You have tea so often that I ended up＿learning it, that's all...... Oh!? When did I＿remember this stuff?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tomas té tan seguido que acabé＿aprendiéndolo, eso es todo...... ¡¿Eh?!＿¿Cuándo recordé estas cosas?」"

msgid "Taiga「How should I know? But you have＿been acting more normal lately.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Cómo voy a saberlo? Pero últimamente＿has estado actuando más normal.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So it seems...... So, is Assam tea okay?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso parece...... Entonces,＿¿está bien el té Assam?」"

msgid "Taiga「Mm, I leave the matter to your＿discretion.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Mm, dejo el asunto a tu＿entera discreción.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You some kind of princess now?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ahora te crees princesa o qué?」"

msgid "Minori「What's this, Taiga no Tsukaima?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Qué es esto, Taiga no Tsukaima?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Y eso qué es?」"

msgid "Minori「Whoops, it's nothing! Forget I said it!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ups, no es nada! ¡Olvida que lo dije!」"

msgid "Minori「Don't sweat it, don't sweat it. Please＿enjoy your stay.」"
msgstr "Minori「No te preocupes, no te preocupes. Por＿favor, disfruten su estancia.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Maybe I am?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Será que sí lo soy?」"

msgid "Minori「Yup yup, you will. Hey now, you should＿take more milk and sugar than that.」"
msgstr "Minori「Sip, sip, lo harás. Oye, deberías llevar＿más leche y azúcar que eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Only Taiga will use them, so any more＿would be too much.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Solo Taiga los usará, así que＿más de esto sería demasiado.」"

msgid "Minori「Whoops, Kushieda's trying to help too＿much! Beg your pardon, sir～♪」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Ups, Kushieda está ayudando de más!＿¡Mil disculpas, caballero～♪」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Haha.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Jaja.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm back.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya volví.」"

msgid "Taiga「What, back so soon?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Qué, ya volviste tan pronto?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's with that attitude?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Y esa actitud?」"

msgid "Taiga「I saw you and Minorin flirting over＿there.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Los vi a ti y a Minorin＿coqueteando por allá.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-We weren't flirting!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡N-No estábamos coqueteando!」"

msgid "Taiga「Don't shout.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No grites.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, shit!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Ah, mierda!」"

msgid "Taiga「But I noticed Minorin was working her＿way closer to you. Pretty good＿atmosphere you two had going on.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero noté que Minorin se te estaba＿acercando poco a poco. Había muy buen＿ambiente entre ustedes dos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Are you trying to instigate something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Intentas provocar algo o qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「I was merely describing what I＿witnessed...... But maybe......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo describía lo que presencié......＿Pero tal vez......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is that \"complex\" train of thought even＿reliable?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Ese hilo de ideas \"complejo\"＿es siquiera fiable?」"

msgid "Taiga「D-Did you really just say that!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿D-De verdad acabas de decir eso?!」"

msgid "Minori「Now now, you two, no fighting.」"
msgstr "Minori「Ya, ya, ustedes dos, no peleen.」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, Minorin!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ah, Minorin!」"

msgid "Minori「Whatcha wanna talk to little ol' me＿about? Make it quick for me, if you＿can.」"
msgstr "Minori「¿De qué quieres hablar conmigo? Hazlo＿rápido si puedes, por favor.」"

msgid "Taiga「Huh? Q-Quick? Uhh, well......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Eh? ¿R-Rápido? Eh, bueno......」"

msgid "Minori「5, 4, 3......」"
msgstr "Minori「5, 4, 3......」"

msgid "Taiga「Aaah! Wait a second! Oh, um, err......」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Aaah! ¡Espera un segundo! Ah, ehm......」"

msgid "Minori「I'm just joking. No rush. Shall I clear＿away these plates?」"
msgstr "Minori「Solo bromeo. Sin prisa.＿¿Retiro estos platos?」"

msgid "Taiga「Uh, sure...... I was wondering, when did＿you send out your New Year's cards?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Eh, claro...... Me preguntaba cuándo＿enviaste tus tarjetas de Año Nuevo.」"

msgid "Minori「New Year's cards? This question you＿have, it goes beyond the realms of my＿imagination. Am I right, Takasu-kun?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Tarjetas de Año Nuevo? Esa pregunta＿tuya supera los límites de mi＿imaginación. ¿Verdad, Takasu-kun?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, why do you ask?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, ¿por qué lo preguntas?」"

msgid "Taiga「Just making sure of something.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Solo confirmaba algo.」"

msgid "Minori「Hmmm, alrighty then...... Let's see, the＿26th...... or maybe the 27th. One of＿those two, bud.」"
msgstr "Minori「Mmmm, muy bien...... Veamos, el＿26...... o tal vez el 27. Uno＿de esos dos días, amiga.」"

msgid "Taiga「I see......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya veo......」"

msgid "Minori「Wait, don't tell me it still hasn't＿arrived?」"
msgstr "Minori「Espera, ¿no me digas que＿todavía no llega?」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, no, it arrived just fine.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, no, llegó perfectamente.」"

msgid "Minori「Didja grasp the full brunt of my love?」"
msgstr "Minori「¿Captaste toda la fuerza de mi amor?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, it was almost too much to＿swallow.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, casi fue demasiado para digerir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That means a lot coming from her.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso vale mucho viniendo de ella.」"

msgid "Minori「Fufufu, my love for Taiga knows no＿bounds...... Was that all?」"
msgstr "Minori「Jujuju, mi amor por Taiga no tiene＿límites...... ¿Eso era todo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah, that's all.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí, eso es todo.」"

msgid "Minori「Alrighty, I'mma go back to work. Ta-ta,＿you two!」"
msgstr "Minori「¡Muy bien, vuelvo al trabajo!＿¡Nos vemos, chicos!」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing...... I'm just thinking. Don't talk＿to me for a while.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nada...... Solo estoy pensando.＿No me hables por un rato.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Is she upset or something?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......¿Estará molesta o algo así?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This conversation is disturbing me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Esta conversación me está inquietando.」"

msgid "Taiga「It's still too early to explain. Drink that＿and let's head out.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Aún es muy pronto para explicarlo.＿Tómate eso y vámonos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien......」"

msgid "Minori「Families have pouring on in since this＿morning. They're all shirking their＿housework. Well dammit, Kushieda's」"
msgstr "Minori「Han llegado familias toda la mañana.＿Todas evitan sus tareas del hogar.＿¡Pues maldita sea, Kushieda」"

msgid "Minori「gonna work!」"
msgstr "Minori「va a trabajar!」"

msgid "Minori「Guess not. I'm always doing something,＿whether it's work or practice......＿Whoopsie, they're calling for me.」"
msgstr "Minori「Supongo que no. Siempre estoy haciendo＿algo, sea trabajo o entrenamiento......＿¡Ups, me están llamando!」"

msgid "Minori「Laters, you two.」"
msgstr "Minori「Luego nos vemos, chicos.」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't have to worry about that.＿After I take my time enjoying my＿dessert, I'll be sure to make it up to」"
msgstr "Taiga「No te preocupes por eso. Tras disfrutar＿mi postre con calma, me aseguraré＿de compensárselo a」"

msgid "Taiga「her.」"
msgstr "Taiga「ella.」"

msgid "Taiga「Besides, there's something I want to＿ask Minorin, so we have to wait for it to＿settle down a bit in here...... Say, why」"
msgstr "Taiga「Además, quiero preguntarle algo a＿Minorin; esperemos a que esto se calme＿un poco...... Oye, ¿por qué」"

msgid "Taiga「don't you get another cup of coffee?」"
msgstr "Taiga「no te pides otro café?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, YOU're so careless. By the way,＿the Darjeeling here hasn't aged＿enough. It won't go with milk. You」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, TÚ eres muy descuidada. Por＿cierto, el Darjeeling de aquí no está＿bien añejado. No va con leche.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「should stick with Assam tea.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Deberías quedarte con el té Assam.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's fine...... Taiga said she wanted to＿talk about something with you, but＿don't you think we should head out」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No hace falta...... Taiga quería＿hablar contigo de algo, pero ¿no＿crees que deberíamos irnos」"

msgid "Ryuuji「instead?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「en vez de eso?」"

msgid "Minori「Geez, you put other people before＿yourself way too much, Takasu-kun. It＿can be a good thing at times, but you'll」"
msgstr "Minori「Ay, antepones demasiado a los demás,＿Takasu-kun. A veces puede ser bueno,＿pero terminarás」"

msgid "Minori「suffer for it, you know?」"
msgstr "Minori「sufriendo por ello, ¿sabes?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Arrrgh, can you not interrupt me?＿Unlike you, my train of thought is＿delicate and complex, so it's hard for」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Aaagh, ¿puedes no interrumpirme? A＿diferencia de ti, mi hilo de ideas es＿delicado y complejo, así que me cuesta」"

msgid "Taiga「me to get back on track once I'm＿derailed.」"
msgstr "Taiga「retomar el rumbo una vez＿que me descarrilo.」"

msgid "Taiga「......Actually, on second thought, it's＿occurred to me that thinking about it＿is pointless. That was a narrow escape,」"
msgstr "Taiga「......De hecho, pensándolo bien, me di＿cuenta de que darle vueltas no tiene＿sentido. Te salvaste por poco,」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji.」"

msgid "Taiga「I was starting to think you needed a＿beatdown, but then I decided it's still＿too early to pass judgment on you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ya empezaba a pensar que necesitabas una＿paliza, pero decidí que aún es muy＿pronto para dictar sentencia sobre ti.」"

msgid "Taiga「Enjoy the time you have left to the＿fullest.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Disfruta al máximo el＿tiempo que te queda.」"
